{
  "uid": "n360-contracts",
  "title": "N360 \u00b7 Contracts",
  "tags": [
    "n360"
  ],
  "editable": false,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "timezone": "utc",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-90d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "account",
        "label": "Customer",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
          "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
        },
        "query": "SELECT account FROM n360.account ORDER BY account",
        "definition": "SELECT account FROM n360.account ORDER BY account",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Data through",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
      },
      "description": "Last day included in this load (the nightly window ends at 23:59 UTC that day).\n\n**Source:** n360.runs, written by load.py only after every data check passes  \n**Filter:** loaded runs only; the latest  \n**Window:** the latest load",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
          },
          "editorType": "sql",
          "queryType": "table",
          "format": 1,
          "rawSql": "SELECT formatDateTime(window_end, '%e %b %Y') AS data_through\n        FROM n360.runs WHERE status = 'loaded' ORDER BY loaded_at DESC, data_date DESC LIMIT 1",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Not reported yet",
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Pipeline health",
              "url": "/d/n360-pipeline?${__url_time_range}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "/.*/"
        },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Last night",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
      },
      "description": "Result of the latest nightly run. A stopped night leaves the previous good night on screen.\n\n**Source:** n360.runs (load.py writes one row per night, loaded or not)  \n**Filter:** none  \n**Window:** the latest run",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
          },
          "editorType": "sql",
          "queryType": "table",
          "format": 1,
          "rawSql": "SELECT toString(status) AS status FROM n360.runs ORDER BY loaded_at DESC, data_date DESC LIMIT 1",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Not reported yet",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "loaded": {
                  "text": "Loaded",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "failed_checks": {
                  "text": "Stopped: data checks failed",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "/.*/"
        },
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Lines above billed",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
      },
      "description": "Lines and pools whose use is over the billed amount, each in its own contract measure (a contract rule where one is mapped, otherwise the platform engaged flag, billable unit unconfirmed). A pool is counted once, as the pool.\n\n**Source:** n360.v_line_pace  \n**Filter:** Customer  \n**Window:** each from its start date to the data-through day",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 3
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
          },
          "editorType": "sql",
          "queryType": "table",
          "format": 1,
          "rawSql": "SELECT countIf(pct_billed > 100) AS above FROM n360.v_line_pace WHERE account IN (${account:singlequote})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Not reported yet",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "color": "transparent",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "range",
              "options": {
                "from": 1,
                "to": 1000000000000000.0,
                "result": {
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Contract lines",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
      },
      "description": "One row per contract line not in a pool (pools below). Used = the contract measure. Not measurable and not implemented lines have no usage (\"Not reported yet\", grey), never zero. Contract unit: the unit of a signed SOW that overrides the entitlement sheet. Click a customer or a line to open it.\n\n**Source:** the platform daily conversation aggregate table and the conversation records reader; contract terms from the entitlement sheet unless a signed SOW overrides it. Via n360.v_line_status, n360.v_line_pace  \n**Filter:** Customer; lines not in a pool  \n**Window:** Used: from the start date to the data-through day",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 14
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "n360-clickhouse"
          },
          "editorType": "sql",
          "queryType": "table",
          "format": 1,
          "rawSql": "SELECT a.display_name AS Customer, concat(l.channel, if(l.sheet_customer != l.account, concat(' (', l.sheet_customer, ')'), '')) AS Line, l.measure AS Measure,\n               s.consumed AS Used, s.billed AS Billed, s.pct_billed AS `% of billed`, s.pct_term_elapsed AS `% of term`,\n               pc.pace AS Pace, concat(concat(toString(toDayOfMonth(l.start_date)), ' ', formatDateTime(l.start_date, '%b %Y')), ' to ', concat(toString(toDayOfMonth(l.end_date)), ' ', formatDateTime(l.end_date, '%b %Y'))) AS Term,\n               l.unit AS `Contract unit`,\n               l.account AS account, concat('/d/n360-line?var-account=', l.account, '&var-line=', l.line_key) AS drill\n        FROM n360.v_line_status AS s\n        INNER JOIN n360.contract_line AS l ON l.line_key = s.line_key\n        INNER JOIN n360.account AS a ON a.account = l.account\n        LEFT JOIN n360.v_line_pace AS pc ON pc.line_key = l.line_key\n        WHERE s.pool_id IS NULL AND s.account IN (${account:singlequote})\n        ORDER BY Customer, Line",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Not reported yet",
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto"
          }
        },
